WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:26.807
[Cold Pulsing Electronic Beat and Off-Hook Phone Signal Intro]

00:00:26.807 --> 00:00:30.500
You stood against me

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:34.111
You chose their side

00:00:34.151 --> 00:00:36.200
You think you're free now

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.293
You think you can hide

00:00:41.043 --> 00:00:44.800
You think those... girls...

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:48.366
Can keep you safe?

00:00:48.406 --> 00:00:51.500
You just embarrassed me

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:54.708
You're a disgrace

00:00:56.869 --> 00:00:59.510
You forgot who holds the strings

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:01.000
You forgot who pays the bills

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:02.500
You think you have a voice, my boy?

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:04.872
I'll show you what "control" still builds

00:01:04.972 --> 00:01:10.000
You are an adult? Let's see how long you last

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.539
CLICK.

00:01:12.639 --> 00:01:15.800
The line is dead. The signal's gone.

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:19.000
I've cut the cord, it won't be long

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:21.607
'Til you come crawling back to me

00:01:21.947 --> 00:01:32.000
How will you talk, boy, when you're not free?

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:39.581
No service. No connection. Just me.

00:01:39.581 --> 00:01:46.805
[Heavy Industrial Stomp]

00:01:46.805 --> 00:01:49.005
You're just a child

00:01:49.025 --> 00:01:50.800
You're weak and you're slow

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:52.800
You can't survive out there

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:55.046
You have nowhere to go

00:01:55.086 --> 00:01:56.800
They'll get tired of you

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:58.607
They'll see the burden

00:01:58.647 --> 00:02:00.500
And when they throw you out

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:02.000
I'll be the one to let you in

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:05.500
CLICK. The line is dead. The signal's gone.

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:09.500
I've cut the cord, it won't be long

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:12.150
'Til you come crawling back to me

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:16.000
How will you talk, boy, when you're not free?

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:19.276
No service. No connection. Just me.

00:02:19.276 --> 00:02:22.697
"Your call cannot be completed as dialed."

00:02:22.877 --> 00:02:25.200
"Please hang up and try again."

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:30.000
But there's no one to call. There's no one there.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:51.802
[Cold Electronic Pulse and Synth Drone]

00:02:51.802 --> 00:02:54.103
You're all alone, Aubrey.

00:02:56.364 --> 00:03:00.000
You're all alone...

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:12.652
CLICK.

00:03:12.652 --> 00:03:16.500
The line is dead. The signal's gone.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:20.000
I've cut the cord, it won't be long

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:22.677
'Til you come crawling back to me

00:03:22.837 --> 00:03:26.000
How will you talk, boy, when you're not free?

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:44.493
No service. No connection. Just me.

00:03:46.238 --> 00:04:02.200
No service... No service...
